{"name":"Illuminate Me","hex":"#eaa601","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"illuminate","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To shine light on something.","To decorate something with lights."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Enlightened, illuminated, made bright.","Enlightened spiritually, divinely taught or inspired; in technical use, converted, baptized."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/illuminate"}],"entries":[{"title":"Illuminate (Shawn Mendes album)","blocks":[{"text":"Illuminate is the second studio album by Canadian singer-songwriter Shawn Mendes. It was released on September 23, 2016, through Island Records. It is a follow-up to his debut album Handwritten (2015). Musically, the album contains music genres pop, rock and blues. The album debuted atop the US Billboard 200 and the Canadian Albums Chart. It was preceded by the lead single \"Treat You Better\", which reached the top 10 on the Billboard Hot 100. This album was supported by the Illuminate World Tour, which began in March 2017."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d2/Illuminate_%28Official_Album_Cover%29_by_Shawn_Mendes.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illuminate_(Shawn_Mendes_album)","wikidata":"Q26181714"},{"title":"Illuminate (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Illuminate\" is a song by Canadian singer Jessie Reyez and Palestinian-Chilean singer Elyanna. It was released on 8 May 2026 through SALXCO UAM and Def Jam Recordings, as the fourth single from the official album of the 2026 FIFA World Cup. It was produced by Cirkut and Feras, both of whom also contributed to the songwriting alongside Massari, and Abeer Sbiat Marjieh."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/39/Illuminate-artwork-1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illuminate_(song)","wikidata":"Q140089751"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/20/Elyanna_%26_Jessie_Reyez_-_Illuminate_%28Original%29.jpg/250px-Elyanna_%26_Jessie_Reyez_-_Illuminate_%28Original%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/20/Elyanna_%26_Jessie_Reyez_-_Illuminate_%28Original%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/20/Elyanna_%26_Jessie_Reyez_-_Illuminate_%28Original%29.jpg/250px-Elyanna_%26_Jessie_Reyez_-_Illuminate_%28Original%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AElyanna_%26_Jessie_Reyez_-_Illuminate_(Original).jpg"}],"sounds":{"illuminate":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/En-us-illuminate.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/En-us-illuminate.ogg/En-us-illuminate.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/En-au-illuminate.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/En-au-illuminate.ogg/En-au-illuminate.ogg.mp3"}]}}}